```mdl
verdict TransportConfig: The type matches, but the Settings schema users edit has no port or scheme field.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-lametric/src/transport/LaMetricTransport.ts#TransportConfig, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-lametric/src/types/Settings.ts#Settings]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-lametric/src/transport/LaMetricTransport.test.ts]
  note: |
    `TransportConfig` has every spec field and defaults ports to 4343/8080. `Settings.Settings`, which the driver passes in,
    declares only address, apiKey, widgetId, appId, accessToken and minPushIntervalMs, so scheme is always https and the
    port always 4343 in the app.
```

